iv></div></div></header></div><main class="blogSingle pt-80 md:pt-[90px] bg-plum"><article class="blogArticle "><div class="ArticleHeader -light -half-width"><div class="wrapper -twentyFive backgroundDrop bg-eggshell overflow-hidden pb-112 pt-32 sm:pt-[70px]"><div class="grid max-w-100% xsx:w-93% sm:w-[79%] md:w-93% blog-lg:max-w-[1276px] blog-lg:w-100% "><div class="row flex flex-col flex-nowrap flex-wrap smx:flex-wrap md:flex-row mdx:flex-wrap "><div class="mx-auto w-100% max-w-100% md:pb-0 md:pt-0 blog-lg:w-40% blog-lg:pb-12"><h1 class="font-bold is-style-default text-charcoal md:leading:80 -tracking-150 leading-38 text-36 md:-tracking-350 md:leading-80 md:text-72 md:w-100% blog-lg:-tracking-150 blog-lg:leading-48  blog-lg:text-42">Building a founder first company</h1><div class="wrapper pb-64 pt-32 w-100% md:pb-112 md:pb-64 md:pt-80 blog-lg:max-w-500 blog-lg:pb-0 blog-lg:pt-0 "><div class="column border-tertiary-gray2 flex flex-col flex-wrap justify-between w-100% md:border-b-0 md:flex-row blog-lg:flex-col blog-lg:pt-24 "><div class="wrapper border-[#DDDBD6] w-100%  md:w-20% blog-lg:w-100% border-t-1 flex flex-row items-center justify-between py-20 md:border-t-0 md:flex-col md:items-start md:justify-start md:p-0 md:py-0 blog-lg:border-t-1 blog-lg:flex-row blog-lg:justify-between blog-lg:py-16"><p class="is-style-overline text-grey-4 mb-0 text-grey-4 md:pb-8 blog-lg:pb-0">Published</p><p class="is-style-p2 text-charcoal md:pt-8 blog-lg:pt-0">Jan 7, 2025</p></div><div class="wrapper border-[#DDDBD6] w-100% md:w-40% blog-lg:w-100%  border-b-1 border-t-1 flex flex-row items-center justify-between py-20 md:border-b-0 md:border-t-0 md:flex-col md:items-start md:justify-start md:p-0 md:py-0 blog-lg:border-b-1 blog-lg:border-t-1 blog-lg:flex-row blog-lg:flex-row blog-lg:justify-between blog-lg:py-16 "><p class="is-style-overline text-grey-4 mb-0 text-grey-4 md:pb-8 blog-lg:pb-0">Author</p><p class="text-charcoal font-bold is-style-p2 leading-22 max-w-200 text-right md:m